    <h3>The pull request</h3>
    <p>The description of <a href={pull(222)}>PR #222</a> carries the completion record with evidence for all six criteria, the verification, the review line, the risk level with its reasons, and the merge approval block. The <a href={href("#trace")}>home page</a> shows it annotated.</p>
    <pre role="region" class="excerpt" aria-label="Excerpt of the description of pull request 222"><span class="src">{pull(222).replace(/^https:\/\//, "")} · excerpt</span>Review: round 5, PASS WITH MINOR FINDINGS, by codex (gpt-6-luna); triage published on #217

