    <p>Most features do not need several rounds. <a href={issue(204)}>#204</a> ran from <code>run-feature.sh</code> to the pull request in 38 minutes: one implementation session, one verification of 909 seconds reused twice, one review that passed. <a href={issue(16)}>#16</a>, the clarification gate itself, took 26 minutes: the implementer received the owner's two comments with the Issue, which settled the design, and the single review passed.</p>
    <p>Source files changed by #204 in <a href={pull(205)}>PR #205</a>: {changed[205].map((path, i) => (<>{i > 0 && ", "}<a href={repoFile(path)}><code>{path}</code></a></>))}.</p>
    <p>Source files changed by #16 in <a href={pull(213)}>PR #213</a>: {changed[213].map((path, i) => (<>{i > 0 && ", "}<a href={repoFile(path)}><code>{path}</code></a></>))}.</p>
